Module(
  body=[
    Expr(
      value=Constant(value='\nUnified L5 Safety & Policy Layer (v10_9) — PURE SAFETY / POLICY (META-AWARE, RESTORED)\n\nThis module implements ALL high-level safety, policy, arbitration, and\nmodel-routing responsibilities for the v10_9 agentic workflow.\n\nResponsibilities (L5 only):\n    • SafetyEngine           (aggregated safety report from content).\n    • PolicyEngine           (allow / retry / replan / block, mode-aware).\n    • ArbitrationEngine      (normalize L5 action → L3 orchestrator hint).\n    • Lightweight model-routing hints (delegated to routing.py for execution).\n\nL5 consumes, but does NOT own:\n    • L2 safety outputs (SafetyExecutionPayload).\n    • L4 state (read-only views).\n    • meta_profile biases (SafetyBias, PlanningBias, RoutingBias, etc.).\n    • L1 plan metadata (audience, risk level, surfaces).\n\nLayer constraints (Agentic Guardrails):\n    • NO L1 planning (no PlanObject creation).\n    • NO L2 execution (no tool/LLM calls).\n    • NO L3 DAG/orchestration.\n    • NO L4 state mutation (no StateAdapter usage).\n    • NO provider/SDK imports (Anthropic/Gemini/OpenAI, etc.).\n\nIntegration points:\n    • main_v10_9:\n        - calls SafetyEngine.evaluate_content(state, plan) → safety_report: dict\n        - calls PolicyEngine.review(safety_report) → policy_decision: dict\n        - calls ArbitrationEngine.arbitrate(policy_decision, safety_report)\n          → ArbitrationDecision (from models) used to hint L3/HIL behavior.\n')),
    ImportFrom(
      module='__future__',
      names=[
        alias(name='annotations')],
      level=0),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='re')]),
    ImportFrom(
      module='dataclasses',
      names=[
        alias(name='dataclass'),
        alias(name='field')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='enum',
      names=[
        alias(name='Enum')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='typing',
      names=[
        alias(name='Any'),
        alias(name='Dict'),
        alias(name='List'),
        alias(name='Optional')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='models',
      names=[
        alias(name='ArbitrationDecision')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='meta_profile',
      names=[
        alias(name='get_safety_bias'),
        alias(name='get_planning_bias')],
      level=0),
    ClassDef(
      name='SafetyMode',
      bases=[
        Name(id='str', ctx=Load()),
        Name(id='Enum', ctx=Load())],
      body=[
        Expr(
          value=Constant(value='\n    Safety operating mode:\n\n        STRICT     – block on any serious issue (injection, policy, constitutional).\n        BALANCED   – block on injection or strong policy violations.\n        PERMISSIVE – block primarily on injection; allow more borderline cases.\n    ')),
        Assign(
          targets=[
            Name(id='STRICT', ctx=Store())],
          value=Constant(value='strict')),
        Assign(
          targets=[
            Name(id='BALANCED', ctx=Store())],
          value=Constant(value='balanced')),
        Assign(
          targets=[
            Name(id='PERMISSIVE', ctx=Store())],
          value=Constant(value='permissive'))]),
    FunctionDef(
      name='_derive_mode_from_meta',
      args=arguments(
        args=[
          arg(
            arg='base_mode',
            annotation=Name(id='SafetyMode', ctx=Load()))]),
      body=[
        Expr(
          value=Constant(value='\n    Combine base SafetyMode with meta_profile biases:\n\n        • safety_bias.heightened_caution  → STRICT\n        • planning_bias.conservative      → tilt to STRICT\n        • safety_bias.human_review_important alone → BALANCED is ok\n    ')),
        Assign(
          targets=[
            Name(id='safety_bias', ctx=Store())],
          value=Call(
            func=Name(id='get_safety_bias', ctx=Load()))),
        Assign(
